Subject: [PATCH] locale: the composed locale sets the app locale on every OS

l10n_util resolves the application locale from the composed locale ahead
of the platform's own candidates. On macOS and Windows the system
language or a stored locale pref otherwise decides Intl formatting, the
calendar and date input width while navigator.languages follows the
profile, so a page sees two locales at once. A locale this build has no
data for falls back to en-US, never to the host. --fingerprint=host and
launches without a composed profile keep the platform's normal choice.

